  },
  "description_short": "Advanced Drainage Systems is a leading provider of innovative water management solutions in the stormwater and onsite wastewater industries. Through its portfolio of products and services, ADS helps customers across commercial, residential, infrastructure, and agricultural markets manage water more effectively while advancing environmental sustainability.",
